    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial family home on one of Salthill's finest roads.\r\n\r\nNiall Browne & Co., are delighted to present Loudres Villa, a substantial five-bedroom semi-detached home on Dr\r\nMannix Road, one of Salthill's most established and sought-after residential addresses. Extending to approximately\r\n161 sq m (1,733 sq ft), this owner-occupied home has been well maintained and combines generous family\r\naccommodation with a one-bedroom self-contained unit.\r\n\r\nQuality finishes are evident from the moment you step inside, with V'Soske Joyce carpets to the hall and landing and\r\nfine marble fireplaces in both reception rooms. The first floor offers four double bedrooms, two of which have fitted\r\nwardrobes, together with a fully tiled family bathroom. A fully insulated attic, accessed by stairs, provides valuable\r\nadditional storage.\r\n\r\nThe self-contained unit, with its own front door, comprises a double bedroom, kitchen and bathroom — ideal for\r\nextended family, visiting guests or a home office. Planning permission is in place for the extension. Outside, the\r\nproperty enjoys a large site with a south-facing rear garden and a spacious separate garage, while ample room to\r\nthe side provides additional car parking and scope for future development, subject to planning permission. All of this\r\nis within a short stroll of Salthill Promenade, the village and some of the city's most popular schools."
      },
      {
